text = "Search the forest for animals and take photos of them when the flashlight hits them. 

Make sure not to take photos of the cursed objecs in the forest or run out of film.

Left Stick: Film to the other side of the Forest
Right Stick: Move Camera
Press Left Stick: Open Photos
When Photos Open:
Right Stick Press to Swap Between Photos 
When Photos Closed:
Right Stick Press to Take Photos"
